		"description": "<p>At your behest, the shadows themselves grip at your foes, pulling and dragging like quicksand. Choose 4 squares within 20ft of you that are in dim light or darkness. These squares become areas of magical darkness which are treated as difficult terrain and remain dark or dim, even in the presence of magical light. This effect lasts until the end of your next turn.</p>",
